{"type":"运行多个动作","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"启用版本发布器==\"启用\" && 启用版本更新器!=\"启用\"","desc":"只启用版本发布器"},"desc":"云发布器③｜清标记并结束本次总控","scriptSet":[{"type":"设置变量","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"清除云工具调用标记","vars":[{"name":"云工具由总控调用","value":{"varType":"string","varScope":"global","showInputInObjectSubVar":false,"mustInput":false,"showInputContentAlign":"left","value":""}}]},{"type":"控制执行","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"发布器完成：结束总控","controlRunType":"stop","jumpToPosition":"","ContinueParentExecute":false}],"runMode":"normal"}
{"type":"运行JS代码","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"特殊模式!=\"只识别状态\"","desc":"仅正常任务需要王者绑定/账号初始化"},"desc":"正常任务：保持人工真实总区数 + 首次红绿点校验 + V5六任务队列","scriptCallbacks":{"afterExecSuc":{"type":"运行多个动作","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"repeatCount":1,"desc":"启动后创建HUD与容错统计通知","scriptSet":[{"type":"系统提示","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"统一HUD：更短更窄纯文本提示","promptType":"toast","promptTitle":"","showPosition":"bottom_left","playAudio":"false","useVibrator":false,"showDuration":99999999,"__vars":{"promptText":{"varType":"expression","varScope":"global","mustInput":true,"valueExp":"HUD文本"}}}],"runMode":"normal"}},"jsCode":"// ===== 王者软绑定：只发请求，不阻塞主任务 =====\n(function(){\n    var __task=String(Date.now());\n    var __req=\"/sdcard/Download/王者绑定请求.txt\";\n    var __state=\"/sdcard/Download/当前王者绑定.txt\";\n    var __hb=\"/sdcard/Download/王者任务心跳.txt\";\n    var __guard=\"/sdcard/Download/农场守护心跳.txt\";\n\n    try{\n        zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定任务ID\",__task,\"global\");\n        zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定状态\",\"pending\",\"global\");\n        zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定用户\",\"\",\"global\");\n        zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定包名\",\"\",\"global\");\n        zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定Activity\",\"\",\"global\");\n        zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定尝试次数\",\"1\",\"global\");\n        zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定上次尝试毫秒\",String(Date.now()),\"global\");\n        zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定耗时毫秒\",\"0\",\"global\");\n        zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定ACK毫秒\",\"-1\",\"global\");\n    }catch(__setErr){}\n\n    // 主任务一开始就建立本轮task心跳。\n    // 是否绑定成功不再决定农场主体能不能开始。\n    try{\n        zdjl.writeFile(__hb,\n            \"task=\"+__task+\"\\n\"+\n            \"epoch=\"+Math.floor(Date.now()/1000)+\"\\n\"+\n            \"time=\"+new Date().toString()+\"\\n\"\n        );\n    }catch(__hbErr){}\n\n    // 守护健康只记录状态，不再stop脚本。\n    try{\n        var __health=String(zdjl.readFile(__guard)||\"\");\n        var __m=/(?:^|\\n)epoch=([^\\r\\n]*)/.exec(__health);\n        var __epoch=__m?Number(__m[1])||0:0;\n        var __age=__epoch>0?Math.floor(Date.now()/1000)-__epoch:999999;\n        if(__age<0)__age=999999;\n        if(!__epoch || __age>35){\n            zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定状态\",\"guard_offline\",\"global\");\n        }\n    }catch(__guardErr){\n        try{zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定状态\",\"guard_offline\",\"global\");}catch(__ignore){}\n    }\n\n    // 只发一次绑定请求，写完马上继续。\n    // 没有while、sleep、ACK等待、25秒超时、stop。\n    try{\n        zdjl.writeFile(__req,\n            \"task=\"+__task+\"\\n\"+\n            \"request_epoch=\"+Date.now()+\"\\n\"+\n            \"attempt=1\\n\"\n        );\n    }catch(__reqErr){}\n\n    // Root如果极快完成，顺手读取一次；没完成也完全不等待。\n    try{\n        var __s=String(zdjl.readFile(__state)||\"\");\n        if(__s.indexOf(\"task=\"+__task+\"\\n\")>=0 && __s.indexOf(\"status=bound\")>=0){\n            function __get(k){\n                var m=new RegExp(\"(?:^|\\\\n)\"+k+\"=([^\\\\r\\\\n]*)\").exec(__s);\n                return m?String(m[1]||\"\"):\"\";\n            }\n            zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定状态\",\"bound\",\"global\");\n            zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定用户\",__get(\"user\"),\"global\");\n            zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定包名\",__get(\"package\"),\"global\");\n            zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定Activity\",__get(\"activity\"),\"global\");\n        }\n    }catch(__readErr){}\n})();\nHUD启动时间=String(Date.now());\n// 新任务必须清理上一次异常退出可能遗留的强制视觉校正标志。\ntry{zdjl.setVar(\"SEL_强制校正\",\"否\",\"global\");}catch(__selInitErr){}\n// 每次启动新的总控任务清理一次性扫描缓存，不能复用上次任务/上个账号结果。\ntry{\n    zdjl.setVar(\"选区总数扫描账号键\",\"\",\"global\");\n    zdjl.setVar(\"选区总数扫描结果\",0,\"global\");\n    zdjl.setVar(\"选区总数扫描起点异常\",\"否\",\"global\");\n}catch(__scanInitErr){}\n// ===== 性能仪表：每次主任务启动清零 =====\nHUD任务=\"准备\";\nHUD当前账号=\"\";\nHUD统一模式=\"是\";\nHUD完成=\"否\";\nHUD完成耗时=\"0\";\nHUD文本=\"\";\nHUD本次行为=\"\";\n临时账号名称=\"\";\n临时模式=\"否\";\n\n当前格=1;\n目标账号=0;\n断点有效=\"是\";\n启动需切号=\"否\";\n还有账号=\"否\";\n账号序列=\"\";\n序列位置=0;\n\nvar 配置名称=[\"1号\", \"2号\", \"3号\", \"4号\", \"5号\", \"6号\", \"7号\", \"8号\"];\nvar 配置区数=[9, 31, 12, 11, 11, 11, 11, 19];\nvar 配置跳11=3;\n\ntry{\n    var 配置原文=String(zdjl.readFile(\"/sdcard/Download/农场8账号配置.json\")||\"\").trim();\n    if(配置原文){\n        var 配置=JSON.parse(配置原文);\n        if(配置 && 配置.names && 配置.names.length==8 &&\n           配置.counts && 配置.counts.length==8){\n            var 名称可用=true;\n            var 区数可用=true;\n            for(var ci=0;ci<8;ci++){\n                if(!String(配置.names[ci]||\"\").trim()) 名称可用=false;\n                var cn=Number(配置.counts[ci]);\n                if(!(cn>=1 && cn<=36)) 区数可用=false;\n            }\n            if(名称可用) 配置名称=配置.names;\n            if(区数可用) 配置区数=配置.counts;\n            var sj=Number(配置.skip);\n            if(sj>=0 && sj<=8) 配置跳11=sj;\n        }\n    }\n}catch(e){}\n\n账号1名称=String(配置名称[0]||\"1号\");\n账号2名称=String(配置名称[1]||\"2号\");\n账号3名称=String(配置名称[2]||\"3号\");\n账号4名称=String(配置名称[3]||\"4号\");\n账号5名称=String(配置名称[4]||\"5号\");\n账号6名称=String(配置名称[5]||\"6号\");\n账号7名称=String(配置名称[6]||\"7号\");\n账号8名称=String(配置名称[7]||\"8号\");\n\n账号1区数=Number(配置区数[0]);\n账号2区数=Number(配置区数[1]);\n账号3区数=Number(配置区数[2]);\n账号4区数=Number(配置区数[3]);\n账号5区数=Number(配置区数[4]);\n账号6区数=Number(配置区数[5]);\n账号7区数=Number(配置区数[6]);\n账号8区数=Number(配置区数[7]);\n跳11号=Number(配置跳11)||0;\n\nfunction 取账号区数(n){\n    if(n==1) return 账号1区数;\n    if(n==2) return 账号2区数;\n    if(n==3) return 账号3区数;\n    if(n==4) return 账号4区数;\n    if(n==5) return 账号5区数;\n    if(n==6) return 账号6区数;\n    if(n==7) return 账号7区数;\n    return 账号8区数;\n}\n\nfunction 账号编号(token){\n    var s=String(token||\"\").trim();\n    if(!s) return 0;\n    var m=s.match(/^(?:账号)?([1-8])(?:号)?$/);\n    if(m) return Number(m[1]);\n    for(var i=0;i<8;i++){\n        if(s==String(配置名称[i]||\"\").trim()) return i+1;\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n\nfunction 解析账号序列(text){\n    var s=String(text||\"\").trim();\n    var out=[];\n\n    // 最快输入：236 = 2→3→6；47 = 4→7；632 = 6→3→2\n    if(/^[1-8]+$/.test(s)){\n        for(var k=0;k<s.length;k++){\n            var d=Number(s.charAt(k));\n            var 已有=false;\n            for(var z=0;z<out.length;z++) if(out[z]==d) 已有=true;\n            if(!已有) out.push(d);\n        }\n        return out;\n    }\n\n    // 兼容原写法：2-3-6 / 2,3,6 / 羊羊-木木\n    var parts=s.split(/[\\s,，、;；\\-—>＞]+/);\n    for(var i=0;i<parts.length;i++){\n        if(!parts[i]) continue;\n        var n=账号编号(parts[i]);\n        if(!n) return [];\n        var 重复=false;\n        for(var j=0;j<out.length;j++) if(out[j]==n) 重复=true;\n        if(!重复) out.push(n);\n    }\n    return out;\n}\n\nfunction 应用跳11(){\n    跳过11区吗=(跳11号>0 && 当前第几个号==跳11号) ? \"跳过\" : \"不跳\";\n}\n\n\nfunction 槽任务(i){\n    if(i==1) return String(任务1||\"无\");\n    if(i==2) return String(任务2||\"无\");\n    if(i==3) return String(任务3||\"无\");\n    if(i==4) return String(任务4||\"无\");\n    if(i==5) return String(任务5||\"无\");\n    if(i==6) return String(任务6||\"无\");\n    return \"无\";\n}\nfunction 任务转做啥(t){\n    t=String(t||\"\");\n    if(t==\"浇水\") return \"只浇水\";\n    if(t==\"祝福\") return \"祝福\";\n    if(t==\"收割\") return \"收割\";\n    if(t==\"十田经济\") return \"十钱\";\n    if(t==\"1V1\") return \"打11\";\n    if(t==\"55\") return \"打55\";\n    return \"\";\n}\nfunction 做啥转任务(t){\n    t=String(t||\"\");\n    if(t==\"只浇水\") return \"浇水\";\n    if(t==\"祝福\" || t==\"嘎嘎祝福\" || t==\"祝福右边\") return \"祝福\";\n    if(t==\"收割\") return \"收割\";\n    if(t==\"十钱\") return \"十田经济\";\n    if(t==\"打11\") return \"1V1\";\n    if(t==\"打55\") return \"55\";\n    return \"无\";\n}\nfunction 首任务序号(){\n    for(var i=1;i<=6;i++) if(槽任务(i)!=\"无\") return i;\n    return 0;\n}\nfunction 应用当前任务(){\n    if(String(特殊模式||\"\")==\"只识别状态\"){\n        当前任务序号=0;\n        做啥=\"状态识别\";\n        return;\n    }\n    var i=Number(当前任务序号)||首任务序号();\n    if(i<1 || i>6 || 槽任务(i)==\"无\") i=首任务序号();\n    当前任务序号=i;\n    做啥=任务转做啥(槽任务(i));\n}\nfunction 旧任务转槽(oldTask, oldMulti){\n    任务1=\"无\";任务2=\"无\";任务3=\"无\";任务4=\"无\";任务5=\"无\";任务6=\"无\";当前任务序号=1;特殊模式=\"正常任务\";浇祝间隔=0;任务4延迟=0;任务5延迟=0;任务6延迟=0;\n    if(oldTask==\"状态识别\"){\n        任务1=\"浇水\";特殊模式=\"只识别状态\";当前任务序号=0;做啥=\"状态识别\";return;\n    }\n    if(oldMulti==\"浇水完了去祝福完了去11\"){\n        任务1=\"浇水\";任务2=\"祝福\";任务3=\"1V1\";\n    }else if(oldMulti==\"浇水完了去祝福\"){\n        任务1=\"浇水\";任务2=\"祝福\";\n    }else if(oldMulti==\"祝福完了去11\"){\n        任务1=\"祝福\";任务2=\"1V1\";\n    }else{\n        任务1=做啥转任务(oldTask);\n        if(任务1==\"无\") 任务1=\"浇水\";\n    }\n    var ot=做啥转任务(oldTask);\n    if(ot==任务2) 当前任务序号=2;\n    else if(ot==任务3) 当前任务序号=3;\n    else 当前任务序号=1;\n    应用当前任务();\n}\nfunction 保存断点(状态){\n    try{\n        zdjl.writeFile(\"/sdcard/Download/农场8账号断点.txt\",\n            \"V5|\"+状态+\"|\"+当前第几个号+\"|\"+当前区+\"|\"+任务1+\"|\"+任务2+\"|\"+任务3+\"|\"+任务4+\"|\"+任务5+\"|\"+任务6+\"|\"+当前任务序号+\"|\"+账号序列+\"|\"+序列位置+\"|\"+总数区+\"|\"+(Number(浇祝间隔)||0)+\"|\"+(Number(任务4延迟)||0)+\"|\"+(Number(任务5延迟)||0)+\"|\"+(Number(任务6延迟)||0)+\"|\"+特殊模式\n        );\n    }catch(e){}\n}\n\n当前任务序号=1;\n阶段需等待=\"否\";\n阶段等待分钟=0;\n\nif(运行方式==\"继续上次\"){\n    try{\n        var t=String(zdjl.readFile(\"/sdcard/Download/农场8账号断点.txt\")||\"\").trim().split(\"|\");\n\n        if(t.length>=19 && t[0]==\"V5\" && t[1]==\"有效\"){\n            当前第几个号=Number(t[2]);\n            当前区=Number(t[3]);\n            任务1=t[4]||\"浇水\";\n            任务2=t[5]||\"无\";\n            任务3=t[6]||\"无\";\n            任务4=t[7]||\"无\";\n            任务5=t[8]||\"无\";\n            任务6=t[9]||\"无\";\n            当前任务序号=Number(t[10])||1;\n            账号序列=t[11]||\"\";\n            序列位置=Number(t[12])||0;\n            总数区=Number(t[13])||0;\n            浇祝间隔=Math.max(0,Number(t[14])||0);\n            任务4延迟=Math.max(0,Number(t[15])||0);\n            任务5延迟=Math.max(0,Number(t[16])||0);\n            任务6延迟=Math.max(0,Number(t[17])||0);\n            特殊模式=t[18]||\"正常任务\";\n            var rr=解析账号序列(账号序列);\n\n            if(!当前第几个号 || 当前第几个号<1 || 当前第几个号>8 ||\n               !当前区 || 当前区<1 || rr.length<1 ||\n               序列位置<0 || 序列位置>=rr.length ||\n               rr[序列位置]!=当前第几个号){\n                断点有效=\"否\";\n            }else{\n                if(!(总数区>=1 && 总数区<=36)) 总数区=取账号区数(当前第几个号);\n                应用跳11();\n                所有账号一轮=(rr.length>1) ? \"是的\" : \"不用\";\n                目标账号=当前第几个号;\n                启动需切号=\"是\";\n                应用当前任务();\n            }\n\n        }else if(t.length>=13 && t[0]==\"V4\" && t[1]==\"有效\"){\n            当前第几个号=Number(t[2]);\n            当前区=Number(t[3]);\n            任务1=t[4]||\"浇水\";\n            任务2=t[5]||\"无\";\n            任务3=t[6]||\"无\";\n            任务4=\"无\";任务5=\"无\";任务6=\"无\";\n            任务4延迟=0;任务5延迟=0;任务6延迟=0;\n            当前任务序号=Number(t[7])||1;\n            账号序列=t[8]||\"\";\n            序列位置=Number(t[9])||0;\n            浇祝间隔=Math.max(0,Number(t[11])||0);\n            特殊模式=t[12]||\"正常任务\";\n            var rr=解析账号序列(账号序列);\n\n            if(!当前第几个号 || 当前第几个号<1 || 当前第几个号>8 ||\n               !当前区 || 当前区<1 || rr.length<1 ||\n               序列位置<0 || 序列位置>=rr.length ||\n               rr[序列位置]!=当前第几个号){\n                断点有效=\"否\";\n            }else{\n                总数区=取账号区数(当前第几个号);\n                应用跳11();\n                所有账号一轮=(rr.length>1) ? \"是的\" : \"不用\";\n                目标账号=当前第几个号;\n                启动需切号=\"是\";\n                应用当前任务();\n            }\n\n        }else if(t.length>=9 && t[0]==\"V3\" && t[1]==\"有效\"){\n            当前第几个号=Number(t[2]);\n            当前区=Number(t[3]);\n            var oldTask=t[4];\n            var oldMulti=t[5];\n            账号序列=t[6];\n            序列位置=Number(t[7]);\n            var rr3=解析账号序列(账号序列);\n            旧任务转槽(oldTask,oldMulti);\n\n            if(!当前第几个号 || 当前第几个号<1 || 当前第几个号>8 ||\n               !当前区 || 当前区<1 || rr3.length<1 ||\n               序列位置<0 || 序列位置>=rr3.length ||\n               rr3[序列位置]!=当前第几个号){\n                断点有效=\"否\";\n            }else{\n                总数区=取账号区数(当前第几个号);\n                应用跳11();\n                所有账号一轮=(rr3.length>1) ? \"是的\" : \"不用\";\n                目标账号=当前第几个号;\n                启动需切号=\"是\";\n            }\n\n        }else if(t.length>=9 && t[0]==\"V2\" && t[1]==\"有效\"){\n            当前第几个号=Number(t[2]);\n            当前区=Number(t[3]);\n            var oldTask2=t[4];\n            var oldEnd=Number(t[5]);\n            var oldMulti2=t[7];\n            var oldSeq=[];\n            if(t[6]==\"是的\" && oldEnd>=当前第几个号 && oldEnd<=8){\n                for(var oi=当前第几个号;oi<=oldEnd;oi++) oldSeq.push(oi);\n            }else{\n                oldSeq.push(当前第几个号);\n            }\n            账号序列=oldSeq.join(\"-\");\n            序列位置=0;\n            旧任务转槽(oldTask2,oldMulti2);\n            if(!当前第几个号 || 当前第几个号<1 || 当前第几个号>8 || !当前区 || 当前区<1){\n                断点有效=\"否\";\n            }else{\n                总数区=取账号区数(当前第几个号);\n                应用跳11();\n                所有账号一轮=(oldSeq.length>1) ? \"是的\" : \"不用\";\n                目标账号=当前第几个号;\n                启动需切号=\"是\";\n            }\n        }else{\n            断点有效=\"否\";\n        }\n    }catch(e){\n        断点有效=\"否\";\n    }\n\n}else{\n    当前任务序号=首任务序号();\n    应用当前任务();\n\n    if(运行方式==\"当前账号\"){\n        var 临时文本=String(临时账号||\"\").trim();\n        var 临时匹配=临时文本.match(/^(\\d+)区$/);\n\n        // 自动≤12：\n        // 不再要求人工填写真实区数。先把12当作安全上限，\n        // 每个已存在区仍走原来的固定坐标+蓝十字确认。\n        // 当“上一地区已经成功”而下一地区连续3次没有蓝十字时，\n        // 自动把上一地区认定为最后一区。\n        自动区数模式=\"否\";\n        自动区数失败区=0;\n        自动区数失败次数=0;\n        自动区数最高成功区=0;\n        自动区数判定结束=\"否\";\n智能区数人工上限=0;\n\n        if(临时文本==\"自动≤12\"){\n            临时模式=\"是\";\n            临时账号名称=\"当前账号\";\n            总数区=12;\n            当前区=开始区;\n            账号序列=\"\";\n            序列位置=0;\n            所有账号一轮=\"不用\";\n            启动需切号=\"否\";\n            目标账号=0;\n            当前第几个号=0;\n            跳过11区吗=\"不跳\";\n            自动区数模式=\"是\";\n        }else if(临时文本==\"9077安卓\"){\n            // 已知存在内部缺区的特殊账号继续走专用规则，\n            // 避免“缺区”被误当成“已经到末区”。\n            临时模式=\"是\";\n            临时账号名称=\"9077安卓\";\n            总数区=12;\n            当前区=开始区;\n            账号序列=\"\";\n            序列位置=0;\n            所有账号一轮=\"不用\";\n            启动需切号=\"否\";\n            目标账号=0;\n            当前第几个号=0;\n            跳过11区吗=\"跳过\";\n        }else if(临时匹配){\n            临时模式=\"是\";\n            临时账号名称=\"当前账号\";\n            var __manualZones=Number(临时匹配[1])||0;\n            // 大区智能探测只适合从前12区开始：先验证前12区，再恢复真实人工总数。\n            // 若用户指定第13区及之后作为起点，必须直接使用真实总数，\n            // 否则总数=12会被下方 当前区>总数区 截断成12区。\n            var __startZone=Number(开始区)||1;\n            // 真正总区数始终保持人工输入值；不再临时写12，避免HUD显示 x/12。\n            // 首次打开选区列表时统一执行一次红绿点去重统计，再决定是否缩减。\n            智能区数人工上限=0;\n            总数区=__manualZones;\n            自动区数模式=\"否\";\n            当前区=开始区;\n            账号序列=\"\";\n            序列位置=0;\n            所有账号一轮=\"不用\";\n            启动需切号=\"否\";\n            目标账号=0;\n            当前第几个号=0;\n            跳过11区吗=\"不跳\";\n        }else{\n            断点有效=\"当前账号区数无效\";\n        }\n\n    }else{\n        自动区数模式=\"否\";\n        自动区数失败区=0;\n        自动区数失败次数=0;\n        自动区数最高成功区=0;\n        自动区数判定结束=\"否\";\n        var seq=解析账号序列(执行账号);\n        if(seq.length<1){\n            断点有效=\"账号无效\";\n        }else{\n            启动需切号=\"是\";\n            账号序列=seq.join(\"-\");\n            序列位置=0;\n            当前第几个号=seq[0];\n            当前区=开始区;\n            总数区=取账号区数(当前第几个号);\n            所有账号一轮=(seq.length>1) ? \"是的\" : \"不用\";\n            应用跳11();\n            目标账号=当前第几个号;\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nif(总数区<=0){\n    当前区=1;\n}else if(当前区>总数区){\n    当前区=总数区;\n}\n\nif(断点有效==\"是\" && String(特殊模式||\"\")!=\"只识别状态\") 保存断点(\"有效\");\n\n// ===== 统一HUD：紧凑单行；不创建后台定时器 =====\nfunction __hud2(n){\n    n=Number(n)||0;\n    return n<10 ? (\"0\"+n) : String(n);\n}\nfunction __hudTime(ms){\n    ms=Math.max(0,Number(ms)||0);\n    var sec=Math.floor(ms/1000);\n    var h=Math.floor(sec/3600);\n    var m=Math.floor((sec%3600)/60);\n    var s=sec%60;\n    return h>0 ? (h+\":\"+__hud2(m)+\":\"+__hud2(s)) : (__hud2(m)+\":\"+__hud2(s));\n}\nfunction __hudBehavior(){\n    if(String(特殊模式||\"\")==\"只识别状态\") return \"状态识别\";\n    var arr=[];\n    if(String(任务1||\"\")!=\"无\") arr.push(String(任务1));\n    if(String(任务2||\"\")!=\"无\") arr.push(String(任务2));\n    if(String(任务3||\"\")!=\"无\") arr.push(String(任务3));\n    if(String(任务4||\"\")!=\"无\") arr.push(String(任务4));\n    if(String(任务5||\"\")!=\"无\") arr.push(String(任务5));\n    if(String(任务6||\"\")!=\"无\") arr.push(String(任务6));\n    return arr.length ? arr.join(\"→\") : \"任务\";\n}\nfunction __hudName(){\n    if(String(临时模式||\"\")==\"是\") return String(临时账号名称||\"?\");\n    var n=Number(当前第几个号)||0;\n    if(n==1) return String(账号1名称||\"1号\");\n    if(n==2) return String(账号2名称||\"2号\");\n    if(n==3) return String(账号3名称||\"3号\");\n    if(n==4) return String(账号4名称||\"4号\");\n    if(n==5) return String(账号5名称||\"5号\");\n    if(n==6) return String(账号6名称||\"6号\");\n    if(n==7) return String(账号7名称||\"7号\");\n    if(n==8) return String(账号8名称||\"8号\");\n    return \"?\";\n}\nfunction __hudCompactName(name){\n    var s=String(name||\"?\").trim();\n    // 只压缩常见平台后缀，保留账号主体，避免HUD换行。\n    s=s.replace(/安卓$/i,\"安\").replace(/ios$/i,\"i\").replace(/vx$/i,\"V\").replace(/^当前账号$/,\"当\");\n    return s||\"?\";\n}\n\nfunction __hudTaskShort(t){\n    t=String(t||\"\").trim()||\"运行\";\n    if(t==\"打11\") return \"11\";\n    if(t==\"打55\") return \"55\";\n    if(t==\"祝福\") return \"福\";\n    if(t==\"收割\") return \"收\";\n    if(t==\"十田\") return \"十\";\n    if(t==\"浇水\") return \"水\";\n    if(t==\"换英\") return \"英\";\n    if(t==\"换经\") return \"经\";\n    if(t==\"选区\") return \"选\";\n    if(t==\"切号\") return \"切\";\n    if(t==\"准备\") return \"备\";\n    return t;\n}\nfunction __hudRefresh(){\n    var start=Number(HUD启动时间)||Date.now();\n    var elapsed=Math.max(0,Date.now()-start);\n    var name=__hudCompactName(__hudName());\n    var area=(Number(当前区)||0)+\"/\"+(Number(总数区)||0);\n    var task=__hudTaskShort(HUD任务);\n    var txt=\"\";\n    if(String(HUD完成||\"\")==\"是\"){\n        var finalMs=Number(HUD完成耗时)||elapsed;\n        txt=\"✅ 完成｜\"+__hudTime(finalMs);\n    }else{\n        txt=__hudTime(elapsed)+\"｜\"+name+\"｜\"+area+\"｜\"+task;\n    }\n    zdjl.setVar(\"HUD文本\",txt,\"global\");\n}\nHUD本次行为=__hudBehavior();\nHUD当前账号=__hudName();\n__hudRefresh();\n// 每次启动总控都重新创建“本轮HUD”。\n// 不再依据旧的全局标记判断窗口是否存在：标记可能残留，但真实HUD已经消失。\nHUD需要创建=\"是\";\ntry{\n    zdjl.setVar(\"HUD需要创建\",\"是\",\"global\");\n    // 旧版标记只做清理，不再参与本轮是否创建HUD的判断。\n    zdjl.setVar(\"HUD提示已创建\",\"否\",\"global\");\n    zdjl.setVar(\"HUD提示创建时间\",\"0\",\"global\");\n}catch(__hudGateErr){}\n"}
{"type":"系统提示","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"特殊模式!=\"只识别状态\" && (断点有效!=\"是\")","desc":"账号输入或断点无效"},"desc":"账号/断点无效提示","promptType":"toast","promptText":"账号输入无效，或没有可继续的有效断点","promptTitle":"","showPosition":"bottom","playAudio":"false","useVibrator":false}
{"type":"运行多个动作","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"特殊模式!=\"只识别状态\" && (断点有效!=\"是\")","desc":"账号输入或断点无效则停止"},"desc":"账号/断点无效：先解绑本轮王者再停止","scriptSet":[{"type":"运行JS代码","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"账号/断点无效：仅写解绑请求","jsCode":"try{\n    var __badTask=String(zdjl.getVar(\"王者绑定任务ID\",\"global\")||\"\");\n    if(__badTask){\n        zdjl.writeFile(\"/sdcard/Download/王者解绑请求.txt\",\"task=\"+__badTask+\"\\nrequest_epoch=\"+Date.now()+\"\\n\");\n    }\n}catch(__badUnbindErr){}"},{"type":"控制执行","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"账号/断点无效：停止总控","controlRunType":"stop","jumpToPosition":"","ContinueParentExecute":false}],"runMode":"normal"}
{"type":"执行脚本","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"特殊模式!=\"只识别状态\" && (启动需切号==\"是\"&&断点有效==\"是\")","desc":"需要主动定位第一个目标账号时执行"},"desc":"指定顺序/继续上次：直接切到目标账号","scriptCallbacks":{"afterExecSuc":{"type":"运行JS代码","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"新账号：载入区数/跳11并从任务队列首任务开始","jsCode":"当前区=1;\n当前格=1;\n需要回顶=\"是\";\n\nif(当前第几个号==1) 总数区=账号1区数;\nelse if(当前第几个号==2) 总数区=账号2区数;\nelse if(当前第几个号==3) 总数区=账号3区数;\nelse if(当前第几个号==4) 总数区=账号4区数;\nelse if(当前第几个号==5) 总数区=账号5区数;\nelse if(当前第几个号==6) 总数区=账号6区数;\nelse if(当前第几个号==7) 总数区=账号7区数;\nelse 总数区=账号8区数;\n\n跳过11区吗=(跳11号>0 && 当前第几个号==跳11号) ? \"跳过\" : \"不跳\";\n\nfunction __新号槽(i){\n    if(i==1) return String(任务1||\"无\");\n    if(i==2) return String(任务2||\"无\");\n    if(i==3) return String(任务3||\"无\");\n    if(i==4) return String(任务4||\"无\");\n    if(i==5) return String(任务5||\"无\");\n    if(i==6) return String(任务6||\"无\");\n    return \"无\";\n}\nfunction __新号做啥(t){\n    if(t==\"浇水\") return \"只浇水\";\n    if(t==\"祝福\") return \"祝福\";\n    if(t==\"收割\") return \"收割\";\n    if(t==\"十田经济\") return \"十钱\";\n    if(t==\"1V1\") return \"打11\";\n    if(t==\"55\") return \"打55\";\n    return \"\";\n}\n当前任务序号=1;\nwhile(当前任务序号<=6 && __新号槽(当前任务序号)==\"无\") 当前任务序号++;\n做啥=__新号做啥(__新号槽(当前任务序号));\n\ntry{\n    zdjl.writeFile(\"/sdcard/Download/农场8账号断点.txt\",\n        \"V5|\"+\"有效\"+\"|\"+当前第几个号+\"|\"+当前区+\"|\"+任务1+\"|\"+任务2+\"|\"+任务3+\"|\"+任务4+\"|\"+任务5+\"|\"+任务6+\"|\"+当前任务序号+\"|\"+账号序列+\"|\"+序列位置+\"|\"+总数区+\"|\"+(Number(浇祝间隔)||0)+\"|\"+(Number(任务4延迟)||0)+\"|\"+(Number(任务5延迟)||0)+\"|\"+(Number(任务6延迟)||0)+\"|\"+特殊模式\n    );\n}catch(e){}"}},"filePath":"切换账号.zjs","continueCurrentAfterFinish":true}
{"type":"执行脚本","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"特殊模式==\"只识别状态\"","desc":"特殊模式=只识别状态时执行"},"desc":"单次识别：只运行查看状态.zjs一次｜不绑定｜无状态提示","filePath":"查看状态.zjs","continueCurrentAfterFinish":true}
{"type":"控制执行","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"特殊模式==\"只识别状态\"","desc":"查看状态完成后直接结束"},"desc":"单次识别完成：立即结束","controlRunType":"stop","jumpToPosition":"","ContinueParentExecute":false}
{"type":"运行JS代码","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"循环入口：王者软绑定维护 + 跳11 + HUD刷新","jumpId":"循环入口","jsCode":"// ===== 王者软绑定后台维护：主任务永不等待 =====\ntry{\n    var __task=String(zdjl.getVar(\"王者绑定任务ID\",\"global\")||\"\");\n    if(__task){\n        var __now=Date.now();\n        var __statePath=\"/sdcard/Download/当前王者绑定.txt\";\n        var __reqPath=\"/sdcard/Download/王者绑定请求.txt\";\n\n        // 正常刷新本轮task心跳。\n        try{\n            zdjl.writeFile(\"/sdcard/Download/王者任务心跳.txt\",\n                \"task=\"+__task+\"\\n\"+\n                \"epoch=\"+Math.floor(__now/1000)+\"\\n\"+\n                \"time=\"+new Date().toString()+\"\\n\"\n            );\n        }catch(__hbErr){}\n\n        // 每次经过循环入口顺手读取一次绑定结果。\n        var __s=\"\";\n        try{__s=String(zdjl.readFile(__statePath)||\"\");}catch(__stateErr){__s=\"\";}\n        var __bound=(__s.indexOf(\"task=\"+__task+\"\\n\")>=0 && __s.indexOf(\"status=bound\")>=0);\n\n        if(__bound){\n            function __getBind(k){\n                var m=new RegExp(\"(?:^|\\\\n)\"+k+\"=([^\\\\r\\\\n]*)\").exec(__s);\n                return m?String(m[1]||\"\"):\"\";\n            }\n            try{\n                zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定状态\",\"bound\",\"global\");\n                zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定用户\",__getBind(\"user\"),\"global\");\n                zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定包名\",__getBind(\"package\"),\"global\");\n                zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定Activity\",__getBind(\"activity\"),\"global\");\n            }catch(__saveBoundErr){}\n        }else{\n            // 未绑定时每30秒最多补发一次同task请求。\n            // 这里只写文件，不sleep、不等待ACK、不暂停农场业务。\n            var __last=0;\n            try{__last=Number(zdjl.getVar(\"王者绑定上次尝试毫秒\",\"global\"))||0;}catch(__lastErr){__last=0;}\n\n            if(__now-__last>=30000){\n                var __attempt=1;\n                try{\n                    __attempt=(Number(zdjl.getVar(\"王者绑定尝试次数\",\"global\"))||1)+1;\n                    zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定尝试次数\",String(__attempt),\"global\");\n                }catch(__attemptErr){}\n\n                try{\n                    zdjl.writeFile(__reqPath,\n                        \"task=\"+__task+\"\\n\"+\n                        \"request_epoch=\"+__now+\"\\n\"+\n                        \"attempt=\"+__attempt+\"\\n\"\n                    );\n                }catch(__reqErr){}\n\n                try{\n                    zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定上次尝试毫秒\",String(__now),\"global\");\n                    zdjl.setVar(\"王者绑定状态\",\"pending\",\"global\");\n                }catch(__retryStateErr){}\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}catch(__softBindErr){}\n\nHUD任务=\"选区\";\n阶段已切换=\"否\";\n阶段需等待=\"否\";\n阶段等待分钟=0;\n\nif(总数区>0 && 跳过11区吗==\"跳过\" && 当前区==11){\n    当前区=12;\n    try{\n        zdjl.writeFile(\"/sdcard/Download/农场8账号断点.txt\",\n            \"V5|\"+\"有效\"+\"|\"+当前第几个号+\"|\"+当前区+\"|\"+任务1+\"|\"+任务2+\"|\"+任务3+\"|\"+任务4+\"|\"+任务5+\"|\"+任务6+\"|\"+当前任务序号+\"|\"+账号序列+\"|\"+序列位置+\"|\"+总数区+\"|\"+(Number(浇祝间隔)||0)+\"|\"+(Number(任务4延迟)||0)+\"|\"+(Number(任务5延迟)||0)+\"|\"+(Number(任务6延迟)||0)+\"|\"+特殊模式\n        );\n    }catch(e){}\n}\n\ntry{\n    function __hf2(n){n=Number(n)||0;return n<10?(\"0\"+n):String(n);}\n    var __hms=Math.max(0,Date.now()-(Number(HUD启动时间)||Date.now()));\n    var __hsec=Math.floor(__hms/1000);\n    var __hh=Math.floor(__hsec/3600), __hm=Math.floor((__hsec%3600)/60), __hs=__hsec%60;\n    var __htime=__hh>0 ? (__hh+\":\"+__hf2(__hm)+\":\"+__hf2(__hs)) : (__hf2(__hm)+\":\"+__hf2(__hs));\n    var __hname=String(HUD当前账号||\"\").trim()||\"?\";\n    __hname=__hname.replace(/安卓$/i,\"安\").replace(/ios$/i,\"i\").replace(/vx$/i,\"V\").replace(/^当前账号$/,\"当\");\n    if(__hname.length>6) __hname=__hname.slice(0,6);\n    var __harea=(Number(当前区)||0)+\"/\"+(Number(总数区)||0);\n    var __htask=String(HUD任务||\"\").trim()||\"运行\";\n    if(__htask==\"打11\") __htask=\"11\";\n    else if(__htask==\"打55\") __htask=\"55\";\n    else if(__htask==\"祝福\") __htask=\"福\";\n    else if(__htask==\"收割\") __htask=\"收\";\n    else if(__htask==\"十田\") __htask=\"十\";\n    else if(__htask==\"浇水\") __htask=\"水\";\n    else if(__htask==\"换英\") __htask=\"英\";\n    else if(__htask==\"换经\") __htask=\"经\";\n    else if(__htask==\"选区\") __htask=\"选\";\n    else if(__htask==\"切号\") __htask=\"切\";\n    else if(__htask==\"准备\") __htask=\"备\";\n    HUD文本=__htime+\"·\"+__hname+\"·\"+__harea+\"·\"+__htask;\n    zdjl.setVar(\"HUD文本\",HUD文本,\"global\");\n}catch(__hudLiteErr){}"}
{"type":"控制执行","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"当前区>总数区","desc":"当前区超过总数区时转到本账号收尾"},"desc":"当前阶段完成：进入任务队列阶段收尾","controlRunType":"jumpTo","jumpToPosition":":阶段收尾","ContinueParentExecute":false}
{"type":"运行JS代码","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"选区V7：首次红绿点去重计数(11% 19% 100% 100%)｜12个保留人工总数｜少于12按实测","jumpId":"选区V6","jsCode":"// 视觉选区 V6：顶部12区直点 + 尾页固定大滑到底 + 仅中间区恢复多次微滑视觉追踪。\n// 核心：不OCR区号，不再猜“是否到底”；尾页靠重复大滑硬顶到底，中间少数区才付出逐行视觉追踪成本。\nvar __target=Number(当前区);\nvar __total=Number(总数区);\nvar __targetRow=Math.ceil(__target/2);\nvar __totalRows=Math.ceil(__total/2);\nvar __wantRight=(__target%2===0);\nvar __bottomFirstRow=Math.max(1,__totalRows-5);\nvar __clicked=false;\nvar __stuck=0;\nvar __maxSteps=60;\n\n// 消费旧版失败标志，但V6不再让它把顶部/尾页强制切进重型校正。\ntry{if(String(zdjl.getVar(\"SEL_强制校正\",\"global\")||\"\")==\"是\") zdjl.setVar(\"SEL_强制校正\",\"否\",\"global\");}catch(__sf){}\n\n// 已实测的12格卡片内部点击点。顶部和真正到底后的最后一屏共用。\nvar __FX=[\"25.2%\",\"63.4%\",\"23.6%\",\"61.2%\",\"22.4%\",\"62.4%\",\"21%\",\"61.8%\",\"23.4%\",\"65.1%\",\"22.9%\",\"62%\"];\nvar __FY=[\"27.1%\",\"26.4%\",\"39%\",\"38.6%\",\"51.6%\",\"51.4%\",\"64.2%\",\"64.4%\",\"76.9%\",\"78.1%\",\"90.6%\",\"89.7%\"];\nfunction __fastSlot(slot,label){\n    slot=Number(slot);\n    if(slot<1||slot>12) return false;\n    try{\n        zdjl.click(__FX[slot-1],__FY[slot-1],100);\n        __clicked=true;\n        try{zdjl.toast(\"选区：\"+__target+\"区｜\"+label,700);}catch(e0){}\n        return true;\n    }catch(e){return false;}\n}\nfunction __bigToBottomSwipe(){\n    // 保留已经实测“一次大约推进6行”的手势参数；不再通过小探针提前判断到底。\n    try{\n        zdjl.touchDown(\"58.2%\",\"90%\");\n        zdjl.touchMove(\"58.2%\",\"10%\",720);\n        zdjl.sleep(100);\n        zdjl.touchUp();\n    }catch(e){\n        try{zdjl.touchUp();}catch(e2){}\n        zdjl.swipe(\"58.2%\",\"90%\",\"58.2%\",\"10%\",900);\n    }\n    zdjl.sleep(180);\n}\nfunction __forceBottom(){\n    // 当前实测每次大滑约6行。按5行/次保守估算需要次数，宁可到底后再多滑一次，也绝不提前停。\n    var needRows=Math.max(0,__totalRows-6);\n    var n=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(needRows/5));\n    if(n>4)n=4;\n    for(var i=0;i<n;i++) __bigToBottomSwipe();\n}\n\n// ===== 只有中间区才恢复旧版多次微滑视觉行追踪 =====\nvar __RED={\"type\":\"image\",\"imageData\":{\"data\":\"\",\"imageWidth\":16,\"imageHeight\":16,\"imageLeft\":730,\"imageTop\":296,\"screenWidth\":1280,\"screenHeight\":720,\"screenDpi\":2},\"limitArea\":\"11% 19% 100% 100%\",\"searchMode\":\"color_2.21\",\"minSimilarPercent\":88,\"quickSearch\":false,\"codeVersion\":\"V1_7\",\"imageScaleType\":\"dpi\"};\nvar __GREEN={\"type\":\"image\",\"imageData\":{\"data\":\"\",\"imageWidth\":16,\"imageHeight\":16,\"imageLeft\":178,\"imageTop\":528,\"screenWidth\":1280,\"screenHeight\":720,\"screenDpi\":2},\"limitArea\":\"11% 19% 100% 100%\",\"searchMode\":\"color_2.21\",\"minSimilarPercent\":88,\"quickSearch\":false,\"codeVersion\":\"V1_7\",\"imageScaleType\":\"dpi\"};\nvar __GRAY={\"type\":\"image\",\"imageData\":{\"data\":\"\",\"imageWidth\":16,\"imageHeight\":16,\"imageLeft\":1194,\"imageTop\":34,\"screenWidth\":1280,\"screenHeight\":720,\"screenDpi\":2},\"limitArea\":\"12% 20% 99% 98%\",\"searchMode\":\"color_2.21\",\"minSimilarPercent\":84,\"quickSearch\":false,\"codeVersion\":\"V1_7\",\"imageScaleType\":\"dpi\"};\n\n\nfunction __arr(r){\n    if(!r) return [];\n    if(Object.prototype.toString.call(r)==='[object Array]') return r;\n    return [r];\n}\nfunction __all(tpl){\n    var out=[];\n    try{\n        var r=zdjl.findLocation(tpl,true);\n        out=__arr(r);\n        if(out.length>1) return out;\n    }catch(e){}\n    // 兼容部分版本：若 findLocation(..., true) 没有返回多结果，\n    // 再用 indexNum 逐个取第1～20个匹配。\n    var seen=[];\n    for(var i=1;i<=20;i++){\n        try{\n            var q={};\n            for(var k in tpl) q[k]=tpl[k];\n            q.indexNum=String(i);\n            var one=zdjl.findLocation(q);\n            if(!one) break;\n            var p=__xy(one);\n            if(!p) break;\n            var dup=false;\n            for(var d=0;d<seen.length;d++){\n                if(Math.abs(seen[d].x-p.x)<5 && Math.abs(seen[d].y-p.y)<5){dup=true;break;}\n            }\n            if(dup){\n                if(i>=2) break;\n            }else{\n                seen.push(p);\n            }\n        }catch(e2){break;}\n    }\n    if(seen.length>out.length) return seen;\n    return out;\n}\nfunction __xy(p){\n    if(!p) return null;\n    var x=Number(p.x), y=Number(p.y);\n    if(!isFinite(x) || !isFinite(y)) return null;\n    return {x:x,y:y};\n}\nfunction __detectRows(){\n    var raw=[];\n    var a=__all(__RED), b=__all(__GREEN), c=__all(__GRAY);\n    var src=[a,b,c];\n    for(var si=0;si<src.length;si++){\n        for(var i=0;i<src[si].length;i++){\n            var q=__xy(src[si][i]);\n            if(!q) continue;\n            // 只取右侧服务器列表；排除顶部“上次登录”和右上角状态图例。\n            if(q.x<145 || q.x>1270 || q.y<140 || q.y>710) continue;\n            var dup=false;\n            for(var d=0;d<raw.length;d++){\n                if(Math.abs(raw[d].x-q.x)<14 && Math.abs(raw[d].y-q.y)<14){dup=true;break;}\n            }\n            if(!dup) raw.push(q);\n        }\n    }\n    raw.sort(function(p1,p2){return p1.y-p2.y || p1.x-p2.x;});\n    var rows=[];\n    for(var r=0;r<raw.length;r++){\n        var p=raw[r], row=null;\n        for(var k=0;k<rows.length;k++){\n            if(Math.abs(rows[k].y-p.y)<=18){row=rows[k];break;}\n        }\n        if(!row){\n            row={y:p.y,pts:[]};\n            rows.push(row);\n        }\n        row.pts.push(p);\n        var sum=0;\n        for(var z=0;z<row.pts.length;z++) sum+=row.pts[z].y;\n        row.y=sum/row.pts.length;\n    }\n    rows.sort(function(r1,r2){return r1.y-r2.y;});\n    for(var m=0;m<rows.length;m++){\n        rows[m].pts.sort(function(p1,p2){return p1.x-p2.x;});\n    }\n    // 网格合理性：相邻行中心距正常约92px，允许滚动中有轻微透视/裁切。\n    if(rows.length>=2){\n        for(var n=1;n<rows.length;n++){\n            var gap=rows[n].y-rows[n-1].y;\n            if(gap<65 || gap>120){\n                return [];\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return rows;\n}\nfunction __detectStable(){\n    var best=[];\n    for(var t=0;t<4;t++){\n        var r=__detectRows();\n        if(r.length>best.length) best=r;\n        if(r.length>=3) return r;\n        zdjl.sleep(120);\n    }\n    return best;\n}\nfunction __pickPoint(row,right){\n    if(!row || !row.pts) return null;\n    var mid=640;\n    var best=null;\n    for(var i=0;i<row.pts.length;i++){\n        var p=row.pts[i];\n        if(right){\n            if(p.x>mid && (!best || p.x<best.x)) best=p;\n        }else{\n            if(p.x<mid && (!best || p.x>best.x)) best=p;\n        }\n    }\n    return best;\n}\nfunction __microUp(){\n    // 只移动约6%屏高（约43px），小于一行92px的一半。\n    // touchMove 后停住再抬手，尽量消除惯性，保证一次最多跨过一行。\n    try{\n        zdjl.touchDown('58.2%','78%');\n        zdjl.touchMove('58.2%','72%',520);\n        zdjl.sleep(140);\n        zdjl.touchUp();\n    }catch(e){\n        try{zdjl.touchUp();}catch(e2){}\n        zdjl.swipe('58.2%','78%','58.2%','72%',700);\n    }\n    zdjl.sleep(180);\n}\n\nfunction __clickTrackedPoint(pt){\n    if(!pt) return false;\n    var w=1280;\n    try{var d=zdjl.getDeviceInfo();var a=Number(d.width)||1280,b=Number(d.height)||720;w=Math.max(a,b);}catch(e){}\n    try{zdjl.click(pt.x+w*0.02,pt.y,100);__clicked=true;return true;}catch(e2){return false;}\n}\n\n// ===== 一次性红绿点计数：每个账号首次进入选区列表，始终先于任何点击/滑动 =====\n// 识别范围：X 11%~100%，Y 19%~100%。只数红+绿，不把灰点计为可用区。\n// 找色可能返回同一点的多个命中，必须先跨颜色去重再计数。\nfunction __scanVisibleZonesOnce(){\n    var w=1280,h=720;\n    try{\n        var d=zdjl.getDeviceInfo(), a=Number(d.width)||1280, b=Number(d.height)||720;\n        w=Math.max(a,b);h=Math.min(a,b);\n    }catch(e){}\n    var raw=[], seen=[__all(__RED),__all(__GREEN)], threshold=20*w/1280;\n    for(var c=0;c<seen.length;c++){\n        for(var i=0;i<seen[c].length;i++){\n            var p=__xy(seen[c][i]);\n            if(!p || p.x<w*0.11 || p.x>w || p.y<h*0.19 || p.y>h)continue;\n            var duplicate=false;\n            for(var j=0;j<raw.length;j++){\n                // 同一点红+绿双命中、同一模板的重复命中只能计为1个区。\n                if(Math.abs(p.x-raw[j].x)<=threshold && Math.abs(p.y-raw[j].y)<=threshold){duplicate=true;break;}\n            }\n            if(!duplicate)raw.push(p);\n        }\n    }\n    if(raw.length<1||raw.length>12)return 0;\n    raw.sort(function(a,b){return a.y-b.y||a.x-b.x;});\n    var rows=[],rowTol=20*h/720;\n    for(var k=0;k<raw.length;k++){\n        var p=raw[k],row=null;\n        for(var j=0;j<rows.length;j++)if(Math.abs(rows[j].y-p.y)<=rowTol){row=rows[j];break;}\n        if(!row){row={y:p.y,pts:[]};rows.push(row);}\n        row.pts.push(p);\n        var sum=0;for(var q=0;q<row.pts.length;q++)sum+=row.pts[q].y;\n        row.y=sum/row.pts.length;\n    }\n    rows.sort(function(a,b){return a.y-b.y;});\n    // 若首排已不在顶部、每排多出第3点或上下行间距异常，属于错页/误识别。\n    if(rows.length<1||rows.length>6||rows[0].y>h*0.37)return 0;\n    var count=0;\n    for(var r=0;r<rows.length;r++){\n        var pts=rows[r].pts;\n        if(pts.length<1||pts.length>2)return 0;\n        if(r>0){\n            var gap=rows[r].y-rows[r-1].y;\n            if(gap<65*h/720||gap>120*h/720)return 0;\n        }\n        if(pts.length===2){\n            if(!((pts[0].x<w/2)!=(pts[1].x<w/2)))return 0;\n        }else{\n            // 正常列表仅末行可单点，且应在左列，防止漏识别误判11区。\n            if(r!==rows.length-1||pts[0].x>=w/2)return 0;\n        }\n        count+=pts.length;\n    }\n    return count>=1&&count<=12?count:0;\n}\nvar __zoneKey=String(临时模式||\"\")===\"是\" ? \"当前/\"+String(临时账号名称||\"当前账号\") : \"编号/\"+String(当前第几个号||0);\nvar __oldKey=\"\";\ntry{__oldKey=String(zdjl.getVar(\"选区总数扫描账号键\",\"global\")||\"\");}catch(e){}\nvar __zoneScanInvalid=false;\nif(__zoneKey!==__oldKey){\n    // 先保存账号键：同账号即使有后续六任务或多区切换也不重复统计或累加。\n    try{zdjl.setVar(\"选区总数扫描账号键\",__zoneKey,\"global\");}catch(e){}\n    var __detected=__scanVisibleZonesOnce();\n    try{zdjl.setVar(\"选区总数扫描结果\",__detected,\"global\");}catch(e){}\n    if(__detected>=1&&__detected<12){\n        总数区=__detected;\n        自动区数模式=\"否\";\n        智能区数人工上限=0;\n        try{zdjl.setVar(\"总数区\",__detected,\"global\");}catch(e){}\n        try{zdjl.toast(\"选区首次扫描：\"+__detected+\"个红绿点，本次按\"+__detected+\"区运行\",1600);}catch(e){}\n    }else if(__detected===12){\n        // 12个是当前屏的可见容量，不是实际账号总数，保留用户输入的20/28/36等。\n        自动区数模式=\"否\";\n        智能区数人工上限=0;\n        try{zdjl.toast(\"选区首次扫描：12个，按原设定\"+总数区+\"区运行\",1300);}catch(e){}\n    }else{\n        // 无法可靠数清时禁止据此把人工20区误改成0或11，保留原值。\n        try{zdjl.toast(\"红绿点扫描不可靠，保留原设定\"+总数区+\"区\",1800);}catch(e){}\n    }\n    if(__detected>=1&&__detected<12 && Number(当前区)>Number(总数区)){\n        __zoneScanInvalid=true;\n        try{zdjl.setVar(\"选区总数扫描起点异常\",\"是\",\"global\");}catch(e){}\n        try{zdjl.toast(\"起始\"+当前区+\"区超出检测的\"+总数区+\"区，停止避免误选\",3000);}catch(e){}\n    }\n}\n// 总数有可能从人工20区缩减成实测8区，按新的有效总数重算坐标与尾页。\n__total=Number(总数区);\n__totalRows=Math.ceil(__total/2);\n__bottomFirstRow=Math.max(1,__totalRows-5);\nif(!__zoneScanInvalid){\n// ===== 快速两端 =====\nif(__target>=1&&__target<=__total){\n    if(__target<=12){\n        // 前12区：列表默认顶部，完全不滚动、不找图。\n        __fastSlot(__target,\"顶部直点\");\n    }else if(__targetRow>=__bottomFirstRow){\n        // 最后一屏：适用于任意总区数。19/24/31/36都会自动套用，不写死31区。\n        __forceBottom();\n        // 大下拉全部完成后，额外等待1秒，等列表稳定后再点击目标区。\n        zdjl.sleep(1000);\n        var __lastSlot=(__total%2===0)?12:11;\n        var __tailSlot=__lastSlot-(__total-__target);\n        __fastSlot(__tailSlot,\"尾页到底\");\n    }\n}\n\nif(!__clicked&&__target>12&&__targetRow<__bottomFirstRow&&__target<=__total){\n    var __firstLogicalRow=1;\n    var __rows=__detectStable();\n    if(__rows.length>0){\n        var __prevTop=__rows[0].y;\n        for(var __step=0;__step<__maxSteps;__step++){\n            var __idx=__targetRow-__firstLogicalRow;\n            if(__idx>=0&&__idx<__rows.length){\n                var __row=__rows[__idx];\n                if(__row.y>=150&&__row.y<=685){\n                    var __pt=__pickPoint(__row,__wantRight);\n                    if(__pt&&__clickTrackedPoint(__pt)){\n                        try{zdjl.toast(\"选区：\"+__target+\"区｜中段微滑\",900);}catch(e3){}\n                        break;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            __microUp();\n            var __newRows=__detectStable();\n            if(__newRows.length===0){\n                __stuck++;\n                if(__stuck>=4) break;\n                continue;\n            }\n            var __newTop=__newRows[0].y;\n            if(__newTop>__prevTop+10){\n                __firstLogicalRow++;\n                __stuck=0;\n            }else if(Math.abs(__newTop-__prevTop)<5){\n                __stuck++;\n            }else{\n                __stuck=0;\n            }\n            __prevTop=__newTop;\n            __rows=__newRows;\n            if(__firstLogicalRow>__targetRow||__stuck>=6) break;\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nif(!__clicked){\n    try{zdjl.toast(\"选区未可靠定位第\"+__target+\"区，蓝十字失败后自动归顶重试\",1800);}catch(e){}\n}\n}\n"}
{"type":"控制执行","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"选区扫描超界保护：开始区大于真实检测区数，停止避免误进别区","condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"String(zdjl.getVar(\"选区总数扫描起点异常\",\"global\")||\"否\")==\"是\""},"controlRunType":"stop","jumpToPosition":"","ContinueParentExecute":false}
{"type":"控制执行","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"蓝色十字100ms快速判定；失败才归顶并进入视觉校正","scriptCallbacks":{"beforeStartExec":{"type":"运行多个动作","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"蓝色十字优先验证：出现即结束，不再做第二次固定等待","scriptSet":[{"type":"设置变量","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"清零选区成功次数","vars":[{"name":"选区成功命中次数","value":{"varType":"number","varScope":"global","showInputInObjectSubVar":false,"mustInput":false,"showInputContentAlign":"left","number":0}}]},{"type":"控制执行","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"condition":{"type":"image","repeatWhenFalse":true,"repeatWhenFalseLimitTimes":10,"repeatWhenFalseRepeatDelay":100,"checkBeforeDelay":true,"image":{"type":"image","imageData":{"data":"","imageWidth":57,"imageHeight":85,"imageLeft":1100,"imageTop":572,"screenWidth":1280,"screenHeight":720,"screenDpi":2},"limitArea":"83.8% 74% 92.5% 95.8%","searchMode":"color_2.21","minSimilarPercent":87,"quickSearch":true,"codeVersion":"V1_7","imageScaleType":"dpi"},"desc":""},"desc":"蓝色十字快速判定：100ms轮询，出现立即成功","scriptCallbacks":{"afterExecSuc":{"type":"运行多个动作","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"蓝色十字出现：原生标记成功 + 自动区数记录","scriptSet":[{"type":"设置变量","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"蓝色十字出现：标记成功","vars":[{"name":"选区成功命中次数","value":{"varType":"number","varScope":"global","showInputInObjectSubVar":false,"mustInput":false,"showInputContentAlign":"left","number":1}}]},{"type":"设置变量","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"蓝色十字出现：关闭强制校正","vars":[{"name":"SEL_强制校正","value":{"varType":"string","varScope":"global","showInputInObjectSubVar":false,"mustInput":false,"showInputContentAlign":"left","value":"否"}}]},{"type":"运行JS代码","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"自动区数：记录最高已确认区/恢复人工上限","jsCode":"if(String(自动区数模式||\"\")==\"是\"){\n    var __okZone=Number(当前区)||0;\n    if(__okZone>Number(自动区数最高成功区||0)) 自动区数最高成功区=__okZone;\n    自动区数失败区=0;\n    自动区数失败次数=0;\n    自动区数判定结束=\"否\";\n    if(__okZone>=12 && Number(智能区数人工上限||0)>12){\n        总数区=Number(智能区数人工上限);\n        智能区数人工上限=0;\n        自动区数模式=\"否\";\n        try{zdjl.toast(\"智能区数：前12区完整，继续按人工\"+总数区+\"区\",1800);}catch(e2){}\n    }\n}"}],"runMode":"normal"}},"controlRunType":"waitDelay","jumpToPosition":"","ContinueParentExecute":false}],"runMode":"normal"},"afterExecFinish":{"type":"运行多个动作","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"Number(选区成功命中次数||0)==0","desc":"蓝色十字轮询超时仍未出现"},"desc":"蓝色十字未出现：自动≤12先轻量重试/推断末区，其余走原重型校正","scriptSet":[{"type":"运行JS代码","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"自动≤12：记录本区蓝十字失败次数并判断是否已经到末区","jsCode":"自动区数判定结束=\"否\";\nif(String(自动区数模式||\"\")==\"是\"){\n    var __z=Number(当前区)||0;\n    if(Number(自动区数失败区||0)==__z){\n        自动区数失败次数=Number(自动区数失败次数||0)+1;\n    }else{\n        自动区数失败区=__z;\n        自动区数失败次数=1;\n    }\n\n    // 只有“上一地区已经真实成功进入过”时，才能把当前失败理解为末区。\n    // 这样开始区填错、页面没准备好、第一次就失败时都不会误判总区数。\n    var __prevConfirmed=(Number(自动区数最高成功区||0)>=__z-1);\n    if(__z>1 && __z<=12 && __prevConfirmed && Number(自动区数失败次数||0)>=3){\n        总数区=__z-1;\n        当前区=__z; // 保持 > 总数区，回循环入口后自然进入阶段收尾\n        自动区数判定结束=\"是\";\n        智能区数人工上限=0;\n        自动区数失败区=0;\n        自动区数失败次数=0;\n        try{zdjl.toast(\"自动区数：确认共\"+总数区+\"区\",1800);}catch(e){}\n    }\n}"},{"type":"控制执行","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"自动区数模式==\"是\" && 自动区数判定结束==\"是\"","desc":"自动区数已经确认末区"},"desc":"自动≤12：末区确认后回循环入口进入阶段收尾","controlRunType":"jumpTo","jumpToPosition":":循环入口","ContinueParentExecute":false},{"type":"控制执行","delay":"0.2","delayUnit":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"自动区数模式==\"是\" && 自动区数判定结束!=\"是\" && Number(自动区数失败次数||0)<3","desc":"自动≤12尚未达到3次失败"},"desc":"自动≤12：短等待后直接重点同一区，不做重型归顶","controlRunType":"jumpTo","jumpToPosition":":选区V6","ContinueParentExecute":false},{"type":"设置变量","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"(自动区数模式!=\"是\" || Number(自动区数失败次数||0)>=3)","desc":"非自动模式，或自动模式无法安全推断时才做重型校正"},"desc":"下一轮启用重型视觉校正","vars":[{"name":"SEL_强制校正","value":{"varType":"string","varScope":"global","showInputInObjectSubVar":false,"mustInput":false,"showInputContentAlign":"left","value":"是"}}]},{"type":"滑动","duration":"1200","delay":"0.15","delayUnit":1,"repeatCount":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"(自动区数模式!=\"是\" || Number(自动区数失败次数||0)>=3)","desc":"非自动模式，或自动模式无法安全推断时才做重型校正"},"desc":"选区失败重试：向下拉回顶部第1次","startPos":{"type":"location","x":"58.2%","y":"18%"},"endPos":{"type":"location","x":"58.2%","y":"90%"}},{"type":"滑动","duration":"1200","delay":"0.15","delayUnit":1,"repeatCount":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"(自动区数模式!=\"是\" || Number(自动区数失败次数||0)>=3)","desc":"非自动模式，或自动模式无法安全推断时才做重型校正"},"desc":"选区失败重试：向下拉回顶部第2次","startPos":{"type":"location","x":"58.2%","y":"18%"},"endPos":{"type":"location","x":"58.2%","y":"90%"}},{"type":"滑动","duration":"1200","delay":"0.15","delayUnit":1,"repeatCount":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"(自动区数模式!=\"是\" || Number(自动区数失败次数||0)>=3)","desc":"非自动模式，或自动模式无法安全推断时才做重型校正"},"desc":"选区失败重试：向下拉回顶部第3次","startPos":{"type":"location","x":"58.2%","y":"18%"},"endPos":{"type":"location","x":"58.2%","y":"90%"}},{"type":"控制执行","delay":"0.2","delayUnit":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","expression":"(自动区数模式!=\"是\" || Number(自动区数失败次数||0)>=3)","desc":"非自动模式，或自动模式无法安全推断时才做重型校正"},"desc":"归顶后重新执行视觉行追踪选区","controlRunType":"jumpTo","jumpToPosition":":选区V6","ContinueParentExecute":false}],"runMode":"normal"}},"controlRunType":"waitDelay","jumpToPosition":"","ContinueParentExecute":false}
{"type":"执行脚本","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"scriptCallbacks":{"beforeStartExec":{"type":"运行JS代码","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"desc":"更新HUD账号与主任务","jsCode":"// 当前账号名称\nif(临时模式==\"是\"){\n    HUD当前账号=String(临时账号名称||\"\");\n}else{\n    if(当前第几个号==1) HUD当前账号=String(账号1名称||\"1号\");\n    else if(当前第几个号==2) HUD当前账号=String(账号2名称||\"2号\");\n    else if(当前第几个号==3) HUD当前账号=String(账号3名称||\"3号\");\n    else if(当前第几个号==4) HUD当前账号=String(账号4名称||\"4号\");\n    else if(当前第几个号==5) HUD当前账号=String(账号5名称||\"5号\");\n    else if(当前第几个号==6) HUD当前账号=String(账号6名称||\"6号\");\n    else if(当前第几个号==7) HUD当前账号=String(账号7名称||\"7号\");\n    else if(当前第几个号==8) HUD当前账号=String(账号8名称||\"8号\");\n    else HUD当前账号=\"?\";\n}\n\n// HUD只显示“主任务”，不显示后续扫描识别。\n// 打11/打55进入子脚本后仍一直保持打11/打55。\nif(做啥==\"打11\"){\n    HUD任务=\"打11\";\n}else if(做啥==\"打55\"){\n    HUD任务=\"打55\";\n}else if(做啥==\"祝福\" || 做啥==\"嘎嘎祝福\" || 做啥==\"祝福右边\"){\n    HUD任务=\"祝福\";\n}else if(做啥==\"收割\"){\n    HUD任务=\"收割\";\n}else if(做啥==\"十钱\"){\n    HUD任务=\"十田\";\n}else if(做啥==\"只浇水\"){\n    if(换作物吗==\"换英雄\") HUD任务=\"换英\";\n    else if(换作物吗==\"换经济\") HUD任务=\"换经\";\n    else HUD任务=\"浇水\";\n}else{\n    HUD任务=\"\";\n}\n\n// HUD轻量刷新：紧凑单行；性能统计只写文件，不占屏幕。\ntry{\n    function __hf2(n){n=Number(n)||0;return n<10?(\"0\"+n):String(n);}\n    var __hms=Math.max(0,Date.now()-(Number(HUD启动时间)||Date.now()));\n    var __hsec=Math.floor(__hms/1000);\n    var __hh=Math.floor(__hsec/3600), __hm=Math.floor((__hsec%3600)/60), __hs=__hsec%60;\n    var __htime=__hh>0 ? (__hh+\":\"+__hf2(__hm)+\":\"+__hf2(__hs)) : (__hf2(__hm)+\":\"+__hf2(__hs));\n    var __hname=String(HUD当前账号||\"\").trim()||\"?\";\n    __hname=__hname.replace(/安卓$/i,\"安\").replace(/ios$/i,\"i\").replace(/vx$/i,\"V\").replace(/^当前账号$/,\"当\");\n    if(__hname.length>6) __hname=__hname.slice(0,6);\n    var __harea=(Number(当前区)||0)+\"/\"+(Number(总数区)||0);\n    var __htask=String(HUD任务||\"\").trim()||\"运行\";\n    if(__htask==\"打11\") __htask=\"11\";\n    else if(__htask==\"打55\") __htask=\"55\";\n    else if(__htask==\"祝福\") __htask=\"福\";\n    else if(__htask==\"收割\") __htask=\"收\";\n    else if(__htask==\"十田\") __htask=\"十\";\n    else if(__htask==\"浇水\") __htask=\"水\";\n    else if(__htask==\"换英\") __htask=\"英\";\n    else if(__htask==\"换经\") __htask=\"经\";\n    else if(__htask==\"选区\") __htask=\"选\";\n    else if(__htask==\"切号\") __htask=\"切\";\n    else if(__htask==\"准备\") __htask=\"备\";\n    HUD文本=__htime+\"·\"+__hname+\"·\"+__harea+\"·\"+__htask;\n    zdjl.setVar(\"HUD文本\",HUD文本,\"global\");\n}catch(__hudLiteErr){}\n"}},"filePath":"进游戏关闭广告.zjs","continueCurrentAfterFinish":true}
